flowchart TB
  subgraph clients [FridayX clients - same engine everywhere]
    CLI["friday - terminal agent (cli/)"]
    VS["VS Code extension (ide/vscode)"]
    JB["JetBrains, Zed and other ACP editors (friday agent stdio)"]
  end

  VS -->|launches| CLI
  JB -->|ACP over stdio| CLI

  subgraph local [On the user's machine]
    Harness["Agent harness - loop, tools, diffs, sandbox, skills, hooks, MCP"]
    Files[("Project files + AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md read, FRIDAY.md written")]
    Token[("~/.friday/auth.json, owner-only - revocable token")]
  end
  CLI --> Harness
  Harness <--> Files
  Harness --- Token

  subgraph backend [Friday backend - the single source of truth]
    Auth["/api/x/oauth2 + /auth - device login"]
    Models["/api/x/v1/models - plan-filtered, server-sized"]
    GW["/api/x/v1/chat/completions - metered gateway"]
    Ent["Entitlements: fridayX + plan limits"]
    Meter["Credit meter + token_ledger (feature = code)"]
    Prov["Provider adapters - OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter, ScaleMax ..."]
  end
  Harness -->|"Bearer fxt_..."| Auth
  Harness --> Models
  Harness --> GW
  Auth --> Ent
  Models --> Ent
  GW --> Ent --> Meter --> Prov

  Web["Web, Android and iOS apps - same plan, same meter"]
  Meter -. one usage bar .- Web
  Console["Team Console - edit plans, models, who gets FridayX"] --> Ent
  Console --> Models
